OL,3,GNEWSAMan seriously injured in crash
OL,4,Aduring police pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been seriously injured in a
OL,7,Fcrash during a police pursuit.
OL,9,FDerbyshire Police said officers had
OL,10,Fbeen pursuing a Volkswagen Golf after
OL,11,Fit failed to stop on the A6007 in
OL,12,FHeanor just after 12:15 BST on Tuesday.
OL,14,FThe Golf, which was travelling towards
OL,15,FIlkeston, collided with a Volkswagen
OL,16,FT-Cross - travelling in the opposite
OL,17,Fdirection - at Hardy Barn in Shipley.
OL,19,FThe driver of the Golf suffered serious
OL,20,Finjuries and was taken to hospital
OL,21,Fwhere he remains, the force added.
